2. Single-q tail predicate P_single(γ) = ∃q∈I⁺ ∃t₀: γ([t₀,T)) ⊆ J⁻(q). Variant SET predicate P_set(γ) = γ([0,T)) ⊆ ⋃_{q∈I⁺} J⁻(q). Which is stronger?
